# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0012 (Runs as root user)
# Official upstream excalidraw image uses Nginx running as root to bind port 80 and spawn worker processes
KSV-0012
AVD-KSV-0012

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0022 (Specific capabilities added)
# Nginx requires NET_BIND_SERVICE, SETGID, SETUID, and CHOWN to bind port 80 and switch to worker user
KSV-0022
AVD-KSV-0022

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0106 (Container capabilities must only include NET_BIND_SERVICE)
# Nginx requires SETGID, SETUID, and CHOWN in addition to NET_BIND_SERVICE for process privilege separation
KSV-0106
AVD-KSV-0106
